  "contracts": {
    "source": "0x50670f reads selected pane baseline+0x503:unknown+0x517 resolves actual unknown+0x4bf;upper+0x50f resolves current atlas index+0x4c3 in table+0x4c7;lower+0x51f resolves next index. Table entries supply spectrum pointer at+0 and label at+4. No combined-layout source override in this recovered resolver. Existing atlas pair admission remains authoritative.",
    "globalMarker": "0x509cf4 when centerX+0x531>0 draws vertical from top+0x513 to bottom+0x51f at centerX,then horizontal X-10..X+10 at centerY+0x535;calls0x5096dc for ordered center revalidation/readout. No-positive-X clears native readout fields.",
    "paneMapping": "0x509eac globalY establishes one125-row pane baseline+0x503 and top+0x507;0x507849 establishes three stacked125-row panes and500columns.",
    "combinedCaveat": "Existing combined rendering shows the unknown twice,including bottom trace,while recovered source resolver maps lower baseline to next atlas row. Width entry0x50b06c clears shoulder coordinate flags and0x50b101 calls trace-menu0x5093e0 when display+0x494 nonzero;trace-menu sets mode0 and redraws. This is evidence of trace entry,not proof of every subsequent event or reachability. No automatic source is inferred for combined bottom."
  },
