    "Optional unchecked Select width source from the center pane toggle;only a committed center on actual admitted unknown/upper/lower source panes switches role. Preview/cancel/right shoulder never switches source. Native source lookup occurs during width confirmation;browser makes selected identity visible at center commit.",
    "Exact retained FluxChoice token and selectedFeatureSource admission bind targets;source identifier/hash/preparation authority is unchanged. Unknown-trace duplicate,residual and combined bottom/fallback cannot be automatic targets. Explicit Unknown direct marking in combined bottom remains existing behavior.",
    "Atomic role/draft/origin transition;fresh bracket on foreign-pane center,ordered same-pane shoulder retention. Existing practice drafts/confirmed records preserved when leaving practice;explicit center on practice replaces that current draft bracket. Other sources retain existing temporary storage.",
    "One retained manual wavelength projects vertically on each primary source/difference frame. Cross only in origin pane;20logical columns wide(photo/sampled) or same width fraction on printed860column plot. Caption gaps,separate SVGs,outline,dashes,clipping,continuous coordinates and visible-window edge inclusion are presentation choices. Supplemental fourth difference pane is outside this global marker.",
    "Actual center ordinate positions the cross;no source flux/photo gray/catalog sets continuum. Numeric/separate-tool edit,source/render/activity change invalidates origin/global marker;Inspect alone retains it. Pane/auto option/global geometry are ephemeral and absent from all existing formats.",
    "Release commit,keyboard/touch opt-in,stale snapshot/choice/context/view/CTM/button/option cancellation are browser policies,not Win32 event/pixel equivalence.",
    "No change to integrator,samplers,acquisition counts/seed,grade,records,file formats or1279resource bytes/hashes."
